- (p, q); D - (s)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"A - (p, s); B - (r); C - (p, q); D - (p, s)"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Gaseous State Question 6 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mggotwgb/ded50c2f-ec69-42ac-a3bc-4df586a5d0aa/82af85b0-a38e-11f0-9d8c-33e535796787/file-jaoe38c1mggotwgc.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>(A) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg styl